## Commands

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm dev          # tsx watch src/index.ts
pnpm build        # tsup → dist/
pnpm start        # node dist/index.js
pnpm test         # vitest
pnpm lint         # biome check
pnpm typecheck    # tsc --noEmit
```

