## Critical Context

- This is a `generic-ts` archetype: no infra, no Azure, no deploy pipeline.
  `release.yml` (release-please) is the only ship mechanism, and it's opt-in
  (delete the workflow if you don't want releases).
- If this project later needs a cloud deploy target, migrate to
  `backend-functions` or `backend-container-app` and capture the move in an ADR.

